# Origin gone, and this still answers. That is the whole reason check exists
# beside available: the gate runs it in a scratch copy of the tree with no .git
# in it at all, and every other subcommand refuses at exit 1 before it reads a
# task. A read that reached for origin would make the gate a test of the network.
run check
exit 0
unreachable
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	owns:
	  - crates/normalize
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
stdout
	1 tasks, no structural collision
